  "notes": [
   "Layer-ready Coral Reef paper-craft scene created from games/grove/assets/_concepts/zones/layer_ready_coral_reef_v1.",
   "Every hero prop includes its own thin irregular paper base plate, following the approved desert-oasis modular plate direction.",
   "The unlock-cover layer groups its repeated coral, shell, kelp, and pebble members into five removable regions: shipwreck, chest, anchor, statue, and clam. Every member has `unlockCover: true` for runtime filtering.",
   "The clean cover overlay intentionally excludes bubbles because the first bubble chroma-key pass left visible fringe artifacts.",
   "2026-07-20: foundation replaced with no-extra-plates v2 so prop-owned paper plates do not double-stack on backdrop socket plates.",
   "2026-07-20: foundation replaced with undersea-gray v3, preserving the v2 terrain sockets while shifting the water and ledges to muted gray-teal underwater depth."
